e:["$","p",null,{"children":["This new work develops a fixed-width quantum time-marching method for variable-coefficient advection–diffusion with continuous source injection. The circuit combines Gray-code advection, an efficient source loader, and one reusable diffusion ancilla while keeping the peak logical width to n",["$","sub",null,{"children":"q"}]," + 1 qubits."]}]
